<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L0" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/value-chain">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L0">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L0" name="Open-Pit Mining Value Chain (L0)" processRef="Process_L0"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L0" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L0 Value Chain. Six pillars of the open-pit mining value chain. Pillars 1 to 4 run as a chain from plan to cargo, joined by custody transfer points CTP-1 (Mine to Concentrator), CTP-2 (Concentrator to Logistics) and CTP-5 (Port to Vessel); CTP-3 and CTP-4 sit inside Pillar 4. Pillars 5 and 6 are cross-cutting: Pillar 5 supplies work orders and instrument calibration to Pillars 2 to 4, Pillar 6 gates all work through risk controls and permit to work. Source: 00-cross-reference-and-summary.md (Value Chain Overview, Key Interfaces).</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L0">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L0_p1" name="Mine Planner / Resource Geologist">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L0_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Sub_L0_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L0_p2" name="Mine Controller / Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Sub_L0_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L0_p3" name="Metallurgist / Plant Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Sub_L0_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L0_p4" name="Logistics / Commercial">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Sub_L0_4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L0_e</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L0_x" name="Maintenance &amp; Safety (cross-cutting)">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Sub_L0_6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Sub_L0_5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L0_s" name="Mine plan cycle opened">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L0_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="Sub_L0_1" name="1 Mine Planning &amp; Scheduling">
      <bpmn:documentation>Pillar 1. Strategic and operational planning: LOM, medium-term, short-term, shift execution and dispatch. Owns the block model, dig polygons and shift calendar.
ISA-95 level: 3-4
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 3-4; GMG OMF v2; NI 43-101 / JORC / SEC S-K 1300
Key entities: block_model, dig_polygon, period_plan, shift_production_report
L2 areas: 1.1 Strategic and Long-Term Planning; 1.2 Medium-Term Planning; 1.3 Short-Term Planning; 1.4 Shift Execution and Dispatch</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L0_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L0_6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L0_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="Sub_L0_2" name="2 Mining Operations (Extraction)">
      <bpmn:documentation>Pillar 2. Physical extraction: drill, blast, load, haul and mine services. Source of truth for equipment state (GMG TUM). Internal CTP: Mine to ROM Stockpile.
ISA-95 level: 0-3
Standard alignment: GMG TUM; GMG Mobile Equipment Open Data; ISA-95 Levels 0-3; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 5, 6
Key entities: haul_cycle, delay_event, blast_event, mobile_equipment, stockpile_inventory_movement
L2 areas: 2.1 Drill and Blast; 2.2 Load and Haul; 2.3 Mine Services
Detail: see pillar-models/bpmn/02-mining-operations-extraction</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L0_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L0_3</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L0_6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="Sub_L0_3" name="3 Processing &amp; Beneficiation">
      <bpmn:documentation>Pillar 3. Comminution, flotation, dewatering and product handling, metallurgical accounting. Primary owner of AMIRA P754 measurement points.
ISA-95 level: 0-3
Standard alignment: AMIRA P754 (all 10 principles); ISA-95 Levels 0-3
Key entities: process_node, concentrate_production_record, concentrate_type, shift_mass_balance, amira_measurement_point
L2 areas: 3.1 Comminution; 3.2 Concentration (Flotation); 3.3 Dewatering and Product Handling; 3.4 Metallurgical Accounting and Quality</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L0_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L0_7</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L0_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="Sub_L0_4" name="4 Logistics &amp; Outbound Supply Chain">
      <bpmn:documentation>Pillar 4. Concentrate handling, inland transport, port operations, commercial documentation. Contains CTP-3 (site weighbridge), CTP-4 (port weighbridge) and CTP-5 (final draft survey, revenue recognition).
ISA-95 level: 0-4
Standard alignment: AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 3, 5, 8, 9; IMDG; ISA-95 Levels 3-4
Key entities: weighbridge_transaction, bill_of_lading, draft_survey_record, certificate_of_analysis, commercial_invoice
L2 areas: 4.1 Concentrate Handling; 4.2 Inland Transport; 4.3 Port Operations; 4.4 Commercial Documentation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L0_4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L0_5</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L0_7</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L0_e" name="Cargo delivered; revenue recognised">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L0_5</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="Sub_L0_6" name="6 Health &amp; Safety">
      <bpmn:documentation>Pillar 6. Cross-cutting governance: hazard identification and risk control, permit to work, incident management, occupational health monitoring, safety performance and regulatory compliance. Gates all five other pillars; the permit to work is a gate condition for Pillar 5 work orders.
ISA-95 level: 0-4
Standard alignment: ISO 45001:2018; ICMM H&amp;S Framework; ISO 31000
Key entities: permit_to_work, incident_record, risk_register_record, exposure_monitoring_record
L2 areas: 6.1 Hazard Identification and Risk Control; 6.2 Permit to Work; 6.3 Incident Management; 6.4 Occupational Health Monitoring; 6.5 Safety Performance and Regulatory Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Assoc_L0_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="Sub_L0_5" name="5 Maintenance &amp; Reliability">
      <bpmn:documentation>Pillar 5. Asset availability: planning, preventive and predictive maintenance, corrective maintenance, reliability engineering. Work orders open and close TUM:DT periods in Pillar 2 (work_order_id on delay_event). Supplies instrument calibration certificates to Pillars 3 and 4 (P754 Principle 8) and planned downtime windows to Pillar 1.
ISA-95 level: 0-4
Standard alignment: ISO 14224; ISO 55000 / 55001; SAE JA1011 / JA1012; GMG TUM
Key entities: work_order, equipment_failure_record, fmeca_record
L2 areas: 5.1 Maintenance Planning and Scheduling; 5.2 Preventive and Predictive Maintenance Execution; 5.3 Corrective / Reactive Maintenance; 5.4 Reliability Engineering and Asset Life Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Assoc_L0_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Assoc_L0_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L0_1" sourceRef="Start_L0_s" targetRef="Sub_L0_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L0_2" name="Dig plan, targets" sourceRef="Sub_L0_1" targetRef="Sub_L0_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L0_3" name="CTP-1: ROM ore" sourceRef="Sub_L0_2" targetRef="Sub_L0_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L0_4" name="CTP-2: filter cake" sourceRef="Sub_L0_3" targetRef="Sub_L0_4"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L0_5" sourceRef="Sub_L0_4" targetRef="End_L0_e"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L0_6" name="Shift production report" sourceRef="Sub_L0_2" targetRef="Sub_L0_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L0_7" name="CoA commercial grade" sourceRef="Sub_L0_4" targetRef="Sub_L0_3"/>
    <bpmn:association id="Assoc_L0_1" associationDirection="One" sourceRef="Sub_L0_6" targetRef="Sub_L0_5">
      <bpmn:documentation>Permit to work gates maintenance work order execution.</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:association>
    <bpmn:association id="Assoc_L0_2" associationDirection="One" sourceRef="Sub_L0_5" targetRef="Sub_L0_2">
      <bpmn:documentation>work_order_id links to delay_event (TUM:DT); calibration and planned downtime windows also flow to Pillars 1, 3 and 4.</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:association>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L0">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L0" bpmnElement="Collab_L0">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L0_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L0" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="36" width="1440" height="850"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L0_p1_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L0_p1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="36" width="1400" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L0_p2_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L0_p2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="206" width="1400" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L0_p3_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L0_p3" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="376" width="1400" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L0_p4_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L0_p4" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="546" width="1400" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L0_x_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L0_x" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="716" width="1400" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L0_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L0_s"><dc:Bounds x="110" y="93" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="98" y="155" width="80" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Sub_L0_1_di" bpmnElement="Sub_L0_1" isExpanded="false"><dc:Bounds x="202" y="73" width="170" height="96"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Sub_L0_2_di" bpmnElement="Sub_L0_2" isExpanded="false"><dc:Bounds x="502" y="243" width="170" height="96"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Sub_L0_3_di" bpmnElement="Sub_L0_3" isExpanded="false"><dc:Bounds x="802" y="413" width="170" height="96"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Sub_L0_4_di" bpmnElement="Sub_L0_4" isExpanded="false"><dc:Bounds x="1102" y="583" width="170" height="96"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L0_e_di" bpmnElement="End_L0_e"><dc:Bounds x="1342" y="603" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1320" y="665" width="100" height="56"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Sub_L0_6_di" bpmnElement="Sub_L0_6" isExpanded="false"><dc:Bounds x="202" y="753" width="170" height="96"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Sub_L0_5_di" bpmnElement="Sub_L0_5" isExpanded="false"><dc:Bounds x="502" y="753" width="170" height="96"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L0_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L0_1"><di:waypoint x="166" y="121"/><di:waypoint x="202" y="121"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L0_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L0_2"><di:waypoint x="372" y="121"/><di:waypoint x="437" y="121"/><di:waypoint x="437" y="291"/><di:waypoint x="502" y="291"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="443" y="175" width="118" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L0_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L0_3"><di:waypoint x="672" y="291"/><di:waypoint x="737" y="291"/><di:waypoint x="737" y="461"/><di:waypoint x="802" y="461"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="743" y="345" width="99" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L0_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L0_4"><di:waypoint x="972" y="461"/><di:waypoint x="1037" y="461"/><di:waypoint x="1037" y="631"/><di:waypoint x="1102" y="631"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1043" y="515" width="125" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L0_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L0_5"><di:waypoint x="1272" y="631"/><di:waypoint x="1342" y="631"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L0_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L0_6"><di:waypoint x="587" y="243"/><di:waypoint x="587" y="20"/><di:waypoint x="287" y="20"/><di:waypoint x="287" y="73"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="297" y="0" width="158" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L0_7_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L0_7"><di:waypoint x="1187" y="679"/><di:waypoint x="1187" y="902"/><di:waypoint x="887" y="902"/><di:waypoint x="887" y="509"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="900" y="908" width="138" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Assoc_L0_1_di" bpmnElement="Assoc_L0_1"><di:waypoint x="372" y="801"/><di:waypoint x="502" y="801"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Assoc_L0_2_di" bpmnElement="Assoc_L0_2"><di:waypoint x="587" y="753"/><di:waypoint x="587" y="339"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
